The [[Stone Helm]] is a neutral [[Helmet]] normally obtained by combining a [[Cap of Resilience]] with a [[Stone Skin Potion]]. It has effects resembling an improved [[Cap of Resilience]], giving the same damage reduction at the start of battle, but for longer, and with some additional {{icon/block}}. Also like the [[Cap of Resilience]], it gives critical hit and stun resistance, but gives much more of it.
